<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Bank says no plans to merge listings.</title>
<headline>DBS Bank says no plans to merge listings.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Bank said on Friday it had no plans at present to merge the local and foreign listings of its shares.  </p>
<p>A bank statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>The statement followed a day of hectic trading on the Stock Exchange of Singapore in which the local and foreign share tranches of big Singapore companies converged on rumours that the government might abolish the practice of dual listings.</p>
